msgstr ""
"<code>POST /api/subtitrari-aspect-implicite</code>: barchasini boshlang‘ich "
"qiymatlarga qaytaradi"

msgid ""
"<code>POST /api/subtitrari-aspect-"
"seteaza?stil_font=&lt;skin|ingust|tiresias_info|tiresias_pc|google:Alias&gt;&amp;grosime=&lt;automata|normala|ingrosata|foarte_ingrosata&gt;&amp;marime=&lt;60..200&gt;&amp;culoare=&lt;emisiune|%23rrggbb&gt;&amp;contur=&lt;fara|subtire|normal|gros|foarte_gros&gt;&amp;culoare_contur=&lt;%23rrggbb&gt;&amp;umbra=0|1&amp;culoare_umbra=&lt;%23rrggbb&gt;&amp;directie_umbra=&lt;sus|sus_dreapta|dreapta|jos_dreapta|jos|jos_stanga|stanga|sus_stanga&gt;&amp;distanta_umbra=&lt;50|100|150|200|300&gt;&amp;umbra_moale=&lt;tare|moale|foarte_moale&gt;&amp;fundal=&lt;niciunul|rand|cutie&gt;&amp;culoare_fundal=&lt;%23rrggbb&gt;&amp;opacitate_fundal=&lt;10..100&gt;&amp;jos=&lt;2..25&gt;&amp;spatiere=&lt;80|90|100|110|125|150&gt;&amp;marire_dvb=&lt;clara|ocr&gt;</code>:"
" schimbă și salvează oricare dintre ele (valorile exacte sunt în "
"<code>alegeri</code>; o valoare greșită nu schimbă nimic); sau "
"<code>stil=&lt;cheie&gt;</code>, un stil gata făcut"
msgstr ""
"<code>POST /api/subtitrari-aspect-"
"seteaza?stil_font=&lt;skin|ingust|tiresias_info|tiresias_pc|google:Alias&gt;&amp;grosime=&lt;automata|normala|ingrosata|foarte_ingrosata&gt;&amp;marime=&lt;60..200&gt;&amp;culoare=&lt;emisiune|%23rrggbb&gt;&amp;contur=&lt;fara|subtire|normal|gros|foarte_gros&gt;&amp;culoare_contur=&lt;%23rrggbb&gt;&amp;umbra=0|1&amp;culoare_umbra=&lt;%23rrggbb&gt;&amp;directie_umbra=&lt;sus|sus_dreapta|dreapta|jos_dreapta|jos|jos_stanga|stanga|sus_stanga&gt;&amp;distanta_umbra=&lt;50|100|150|200|300&gt;&amp;umbra_moale=&lt;tare|moale|foarte_moale&gt;&amp;fundal=&lt;niciunul|rand|cutie&gt;&amp;culoare_fundal=&lt;%23rrggbb&gt;&amp;opacitate_fundal=&lt;10..100&gt;&amp;jos=&lt;2..25&gt;&amp;spatiere=&lt;80|90|100|110|125|150&gt;&amp;marire_dvb=&lt;clara|ocr&gt;</code>:"
" ularning istalganini o‘zgartiradi va saqlaydi (aniq qiymatlar "
"<code>alegeri</code> ichida; noto‘g‘ri qiymat hech narsani o‘zgartirmaydi); "
"yoki <code>stil=&lt;cheie&gt;</code>, tayyor stil"

msgid ""
"<code>POST /api/subtitrari-film-alege?id=&lt;id&gt;|oprit</code>, <code>POST "
"/api/subtitrari-film-intarziere?ms=N</code> (sau <code>pas=</code>), "
"<code>POST /api/subtitrari-film-codare?cod=..</code>, <code>POST "
"/api/subtitrari-film-fps?fps=..</code>: aceleași alegeri ca tasta SUB la un "
"film din fișier"
msgstr ""
"<code>POST /api/subtitrari-film-alege?id=&lt;id&gt;|oprit</code>, <code>POST "
"/api/subtitrari-film-intarziere?ms=N</code> (yoki <code>pas=</code>), "
"<code>POST /api/subtitrari-film-codare?cod=..</code>, <code>POST "
"/api/subtitrari-film-fps?fps=..</code>: fayldan ochilgan film uchun SUB "
"tugmasidagi bilan bir xil tanlovlar"

msgid ""
