"interfeței web și din pagina Setări)."
msgstr ""
"Enigma2 resiverlari uchun odatiy ilovalar (pult, kanallar, teledastur, "
"rejalashtirilgan yozuvlar, m3u ro‘yxatlari) o‘zlarining odatiy manzillaridan "
"foydalanadi: XMLda <code>/web/...</code> (masalan "
"<code>/web/deviceinfo</code>, <code>/web/getservices</code>, "
"<code>/web/zap?sRef=</code>, <code>/web/epgnow?bRef=</code>, "
"<code>/web/timerlist</code>), JSONda <code>/api/...</code> ichidagi xuddi shu"
" nomli manzillar, <code>/picon/</code>, <code>/file?file=</code> (logotiplar,"
" telefonda ijro etish uchun yozib olish joylaridagi yozuvlar va filmlar, "
"<code>Range</code> bilan), <code>/web/ts.m3u?file=</code> va "
"<code>/grab</code>. Ular zavod sozlamalarida yoqilgan bo‘ladi (veb-interfeys "
"ekrani va Sozlamalar sahifasidagi «Telefon ilovalari» qatori)."

