"\n"
"Dasturiy ta’minotni (kernel.bin, rootfs.tar.bz2, imageversion) USB fleshkaga nusxalang, fleshkani kiriting va qaytadan urinib ko‘ring. Hech narsa o‘rnatilmadi."

